This directory contains a patch intended to run DICE simulations
with the capability to restart and include additional DICE initial conditions
at restart.

The core of the patch is a new snippet in init_part.f90, case('dice_restart'), which consists of a merge between the case('dice') snippet in the same file and the case('restart') snippet in patch/init/restart, available here as to separate files: load_dice_restart and load_ramses, to be merged.

IMPORTANT: See /Users/tepper/codes/ramses_020217/ramses/trunk/ramses/patch/mySIMS/Nbody+HD/dice/myics/dice_restart/src/init_part.f90, DICE_RESTART snippet
for a guide on how to achieve this.

The required patches should all correctly included via the appropriate make file (to be created). Note that, with luck, only init_part.f90 needs to be modified, and the patch will work by including my patches, my dice patch included.

Specific modifications.

init_part.f90:
- added case('dice_restart') and corresponding routine load_dice_restart

init_refine.f90: See differences between dice and restart versions of the file.
In particular, may have to include module restart_commons, although the latter appears to be a subset of dice_commons.
